{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2021-10-21 12:00:00', 'title': 'FORMULA 1 AND MOTORSPORT NETWORK UNVEIL FAN RESULTS OF LARGEST SINGLE SPORTS SURVEY EVER CONDUCTED BY NIELSEN SPORTS', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS, OCT. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FORMULA 1 AND MOTORSPORT NETWORK, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE RESULTS OF THE 2021 F1 GLOBAL FAN SURVEY. LAUNCHED IN EARLY SEPTEMBER 2021, THE F1 GLOBAL FAN SURVEY WAS COMMISSIONED BY\xa0MOTORSPORT NETWORK\xa0IN PARTNERSHIP WITH FORMULA 1 AND NIELSEN SPORTS, THE GLOBAL INFORMATION, DATA, AND MEASUREMENT EXPERTS.'}